---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Terms of Service & Editorial Disclosures" 
  description="Official terms of use, legal notices, editorial independence charter, and affiliate transparency disclosures for HeliaTech Media."
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 sm:px-8 py-16">
    <!-- Header Badge -->
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-slate-900 border border-cyan-500/30 text-cyan-300 text-xs font-mono mb-8 shadow-glow-cyan">
      <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-cyan-400"></span>
      <span>LEGAL DOCUMENTATION • REVISED 2026</span>
    </div>

    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-white tracking-tight leading-tight mb-6">
      Terms of Use & <br />
      <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-400 via-sky-300 to-fuchsia-400">
        Editorial Independence Charter
      </span>
    </h1>

    <p class="text-slate-400 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed mb-12">
      Welcome to <strong>HeliaTech Media</strong> (<a href="https://heliatech.online" class="text-cyan-400 underline">heliatech.online</a>). By accessing our software intelligence observatory, benchmark dossiers, and guides, you agree to comply with and be bound by the following Terms of Service.
    </p>

    <div class="space-y-12 text-slate-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
      <!-- Section 1 -->
      <section class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="text-cyan-400 font-mono text-sm">01.</span>
          <span>Acceptance of Terms</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-4">
          By browsing, indexing, or using HeliaTech Media, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agree to be bound by these Terms of Use. If you do not agree with any part of these terms, you must discontinue the use of our services immediately.
        </p>
        <p>
          These terms apply to all visitors, registered enterprise subscribers, and partners accessing our web platforms, APIs, and published research.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 2 -->
      <section class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="text-cyan-400 font-mono text-sm">02.</span>
          <span>Editorial Independence & Forensic Benchmark Integrity</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-4">
          HeliaTech operates as an independent technological research desk and software benchmark observatory. Our technical evaluations, performance ratings (1.0 to 10.0), ROI calculations, and hands-on masterclasses are conducted objectively based on empirical criteria:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-slate-400 mb-4 font-mono text-xs sm:text-sm">
          <li>System throughput, latency, and operational stability.</li>
          <li>Enterprise scalability, API ergonomics, and webhook capabilities.</li>
          <li>Cost efficiency, seat-tier economics, and payback period velocities.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          No software vendor or cloud provider can purchase an inflated benchmark rating or alter our critical trade-off analyses.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 3 -->
      <section class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/60 border border-cyan-500/20 shadow-glow-cyan">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="text-cyan-400 font-mono text-sm">03.</span>
          <span>Affiliate & Commercial Relationship Disclosures (FTC 16 CFR Part 255)</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-4">
          In strict compliance with the Federal Trade Commission (FTC) guidelines and international advertising transparency standards:
        </p>
        <p class="mb-4">
          Certain outbound links on this website (notably formatted as <code class="text-cyan-300 font-mono">/go/[tool-slug]</code>) are performance-based affiliate referral URLs. When readers click through these links and subscribe to a software plan, HeliaTech may receive a commission or partner royalty from the vendor.
        </p>
        <p class="text-cyan-300 font-medium">
          ✦ Important Consumer Guarantee: Clicking an affiliate link will never result in additional fees or price increases for the user. In many cases, our partner agreements provide verified discounts, extended free trials, or exclusive onboarding allowances.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 4 -->
      <section class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="text-cyan-400 font-mono text-sm">04.</span>
          <span>Intellectual Property & Media Attribution</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-4">
          All original textual content, proprietary SVG/PNG architectural vector artwork, Mermaid workflow diagrams, and benchmark algorithms published on HeliaTech are the intellectual property of HeliaTech Media.
        </p>
        <p>
          Third-party brand names, logos, and trademarks (e.g., ElevenLabs, Make, ClickUp, Notion) cited on this site belong exclusively to their respective owners and are utilized solely for comparative identification, review, and journalistic commentary purposes under Fair Use doctrines.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 5 -->
      <section class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="text-cyan-400 font-mono text-sm">05.</span>
          <span>Limitation of Liability</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-4">
          Software architectures, subscription pricing models, and feature sets evolve rapidly. While our automated agents and research staff strive to maintain 100% updated intelligence, HeliaTech provides all reviews, code snippets, and masterclasses on an "as-is" and "as-available" basis without warranties of any kind.
        </p>
        <p>
          HeliaTech Media shall not be held liable for any direct, indirect, or consequential damages resulting from technical decisions or software purchasing commitments made by readers.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 6 -->
      <section class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="text-cyan-400 font-mono text-sm">06.</span>
          <span>Contact & Legal Inquiries</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-4">
          For legal inquiries, partnership verifications, or editorial correspondence, please contact our legal desk:
        </p>
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 font-mono text-xs sm:text-sm">
          <p class="text-slate-400">Organization: <span class="text-white font-bold">HeliaTech Media</span></p>
          <p class="text-slate-400">Website: <a href="https://heliatech.online" class="text-cyan-400">https://heliatech.online</a></p>
          <p class="text-slate-400">Electronic Mail: <a href="mailto:contact.heliatech@gmail.com" class="text-cyan-400">contact.heliatech@gmail.com</a></p>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
